    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: VibeGuard – security linter for AI-generated code&lt;/b&gt; — Community-vetted signal from Hacker News — high upvote-to-age ratio means the engineering community found it worth reading. &lt;a href="https://github.com/zeroFhacker/vibeguard"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Introducing Hy4 Preview&lt;/b&gt; — New or updated LLM releases affect tool choices across your entire stack — from IDE copilots to pipeline automation. &lt;a href="https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/29/hy4/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
