&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show HN: Open source dataset cleaner for JSONL outputs&lt;/b&gt; — New release or open-sourced project — quick scan to see if it belongs in your toolkit. &lt;a href="https://pypi.org/project/dataset-cleaner-cli/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scale before the spike: Predictive autoscaling for GPU workloads on Kubernetes&lt;/b&gt; — Kubernetes ecosystem changes can surface new operational patterns or affect your existing clusters. &lt;a href="https://www.cncf.io/blog/2026/08/28/scale-before-the-spike-predictive-autoscaling-for-gpu-workloads-on-kubernetes/"&gt;Read&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
